Package: qore-openldap-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: libsasl2-modules
Suggests: qore-openldap-module-doc, libsasl2-modules-gssapi-mit
Description: LDAP, SASL and directory tools for Qore
 This package contains OpenLDAP bindings, six source/compiled helper modules,
 compiler metadata and seven qldap command-line tools with manual pages.
 It supports directory operations, transactions, SASL, connection pooling,
 asynchronous operations, LDIF and Active Directory helpers.

