Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-openldap-module
Description: documentation and examples for Qore's OpenLDAP module
 This package contains seven HTML API references and test/example fixtures
 for the OpenLDAP bindings and helper modules.
